{"availability":"available","full":"ShibbityShwab/lightspeed","name":"lightspeed","description":"⚡ Zero-cost global network optimizer to reduce and stabilize ping for multiplayer games.","category":"Other","language":"Rust","stars":76,"forks":10,"created":"2026-02-22T14:53:11Z","updated":"2026-10-09T02:42:29Z","license":null,"branch":"master","homepage":"https://shibbityshwab.github.io/lightspeed/","topics":["cs2","dota2","fortnite","gaming","latency","multiplayer","network-optimizer","open-source","ping-reducer","proxy","rust","udp"],"demo":"https://shibbityshwab.github.io/lightspeed/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:40.502Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:40.502Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:40.502Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:38.826Z","stars":74,"forks":10},{"at":"2026-10-09T08:56:40.502Z","stars":76,"forks":10}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["LightSpeed is a zero-cost global network optimizer for multiplayer games. It routes your game traffic through an optimized proxy tunnel, bypassing slow ISP paths to reduce and stabilize your ping - no subscriptions, no usage fees, no infrastructure bills.","How? Your ISP routes game packets through congested paths chosen for cost, not speed. LightSpeed tunnels them through a proxy node with high-speed backbone connections to game server regions. The result is lower, more stable latency - typically 10-40ms improvement depending on your location and the game server."],"features":["Automatic proxy selection - probes all configured proxies and picks the fastest; the GUI auto-selects the fastest relay on first run with an \"Auto (fastest)\" checkbox","Community relay auto-discovery - finds the eight community relays via the signed registry with zero config, or point at your own with --registry","RTT saved - measures the client's direct (ICMP) game-server round trip against the tunnelled round trip so you can see the estimated saving, with the caveat that the two are different instruments","Does it help me? - --diagnose measures one server's direct and relayed path over a few seconds and prints a plain saved/not-helped verdict, with no telemetry required","ML-based route prediction - 11-feature Random Forest model learns from your connection patterns"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ShibbityShwab/lightspeed/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"be296a37b5ebc7b9e2ee68e1848ff10f3deb185e4a6218876431977ceebcf8cb","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:38.975Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:38.975Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"LightSpeed is a zero-cost global network optimizer for multiplayer games. It routes your game traffic through an optimized proxy tunnel, bypassing slow ISP paths to reduce and stabilize your ping - no subscriptions, no usage fees, no infrastructure bills.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ShibbityShwab/lightspeed/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"The GUI picks the fastest relay for you on first run, and self-hosting your own proxy is still fully supported.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ShibbityShwab/lightspeed/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Zero-cost self-hosting - deploy your own proxy on any Linux VPS (500KB RAM)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ShibbityShwab/lightspeed/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"be296a37b5ebc7b9e2ee68e1848ff10f3deb185e4a6218876431977ceebcf8cb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ShibbityShwab/lightspeed/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:38.976Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T02:00:40Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ShibbityShwab/lightspeed/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:38.976Z","hash":"be296a37b5ebc7b9e2ee68e1848ff10f3deb185e4a6218876431977ceebcf8cb","originalBytes":13147,"storedBytes":13147,"truncated":false,"se